socket me 8001

host server ::1 8000
connect me server 123 1

send me server HELLO 123\r\n

receive me server 0.2 COEFF \f[0;0] \f[0;0]

send me server PUT 0 -5\r\n
receive me server 0.1 STATE **

send me server PUT 1 -5\r\n
receive me server 0.1 STATE **

send me server PUT 2 -5\r\n
receive me server 0.1 STATE **

send me server PUT 3 -5\r\n
receive me server 0.1 STATE **

send me server PUT 4 -5\r\n
receive me server 0.1 STATE **

receive me server 0.1 SCORING 123 \f[125;125]

close me server